 en:{kicker:'SECURE GOOGLE CONNECTION',h1a:'Bring your own data.',h1b:'Keep control.',lead:'Connect your Google Search Console and Analytics properties with read-only access. We never ask for your Google password.',stdTitle:'Standard connection',stdText:'Use the CamMicGo Google Cloud application. Simple, free and ideal for most website owners.',cont:'Continue with Google',guide:'Step-by-step guide: create your own Google Cloud OAuth project ↗',advanced:'Advanced · Use my own Google Cloud project',advText:'For advanced users: create a Google OAuth 2.0 Web application and add the callback below to its authorized redirect URIs. Your credentials are used only for your session and encrypted in an HTTP-only cookie.',idLabel:'Google OAuth Client ID',secretLabel:'Google OAuth Client Secret',secretPh:'Your OAuth client secret',redirect:'Authorized redirect URI',submit:'Connect using my Google Cloud project',foot:'Read-only access · Disconnect anytime ·',privacy:'Privacy notice',back:'← Back to CamMicGo SEO MCP'},
